  "body": "Space, Style and Sophistication!\r\n\r\nFeatures and Benefits\r\n* 809sqm (more or less) Freehold site \r\n* Sea/Rangitoto views\r\n* Six bedrooms, three bathrooms\r\n* Beautifully renovated, double-glazed throughout\r\n* Native timber flooring\r\n* Open plan kitchen and living flowing to three decks\r\n* Separate living with kitchenette\r\n* Double internal access garage with extra off-street parking\r\n* Zoned for Murrays Bay School, Murrays Bay Intermediate, Rangitoto College\r\n* Walking distance to Mairangi Bay Village, shops, cafes, restaurants and beach, public transport at your doorstep and easy access to motorway\r\n\r\nA beautiful renovation offering an abundance of options for the whole family. If space, quality and versatility are high on your wish list, prepare to be impressed by this substantial Mairangi Bay residence is a home that truly delivers. Set on a generous 809sqm (more or less) freehold site, it combines modern comforts, timeless character and the sort of flexibility that families desire.\r\n\r\nYou'll immediately appreciate the care and attention to detail that has gone into bringing this home to life. Gleaming native timber floors add warmth and character, while double glazing throughout and fresh contemporary finishes ensure comfort is taken care of. It's a wonderful balance of original charm and modern-day living.\r\n\r\nThe upstairs living zone is designed with family in mind, with the stunning open-plan kitchen and living at the heart of the home, creating a natural gathering place with seamless flow to three separate decks.  Whether it's morning coffee, afternoon entertaining or simply finding your favourite sunny spot, there's an outdoor space to suit every occasion.  Four generous bedrooms, including a spacious master complete with a luxurious his and hers ensuite, plus a family bathroom, provide tranquil retreats for the family at the end of the day. \r\n\r\nDownstairs there's more to discover with two additional double bedrooms, a study nook, bathroom and separate living area with kitchenette create a fantastic opportunity for extended family, potential income stream, guests or those simply wanting a little more independence and separation. It's the kind of flexibility that adapts as family needs change, without anyone having to compromise on space.\r\n\r\nA double internal-access garage and additional off-street parking provides plenty of room for vehicles and all the extras that come with busy family life.\r\n\r\nMairangi Bay is one of the North Shore's most loved coastal communities, and from here you can leave the car at home and stroll to the village, cafes, restaurants, boutique shops and beautiful beach. Public transport is right at your doorstep, with easy motorway access making commuting a breeze. Families will also appreciate the excellent school zoning for Murrays Bay School, Murrays Bay Intermediate and Rangitoto College.\r\n\r\nBig on space, beautifully renovated and brilliantly positioned, this is a home that offers so much more than meets the eye, whether you're accommodating a growing family, bringing generations together or simply wanting room to spread out, 424 Beach Road deserves your attention.\r\n\r\nCall Team Roberts for your viewing now!\r\n\r\nTo view property files, please follow this link: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/BK3K",
